-text-raise: 0pt\">\"</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕\">을 운영할 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕\">본 특강 수강생에게는 특강이 종료된 후 특허변리사사무소를 초청해 실시하는 취업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕\">일자리 박람회에 참가할 수 있는 자격이 주어집니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕\">특허변리사사무소 취업에 성공하는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕\">변리사를 보조하여 선행기술조사 업무를 수행하게 되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔바른고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔바른고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔바른고딕\">좀 더 경력이 쌓이면 명세서 작성 업무도 병행하게 됩니다</sp